---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/ai-mortgage-admin/styles.css';
import '../styles/ai-mortgage-admin/sections.css';
import '../styles/ai-mortgage-admin/motion.css';
---

<Layout
  title="AI Mortgage Admin — More cases submitted. Less time lost to admin."
  description="Upload the case. AI Mortgage Admin reviews the file and drafts the client chase for whatever is missing."
  ogTitle="AI Mortgage Admin — More cases submitted. Less time lost to admin."
  ogDescription="Upload the case. AI Mortgage Admin reviews the file and drafts the client chase for whatever is missing."
  includeHomeStyles={false}
>

<div class="scroll-progress"></div>
<a class="float-cta" href="#book"><span class="dot"></span>Book a call<span class="arrow">→</span></a>

<!-- NAV -->
<header class="wrap">
  <nav class="nav">
    <a class="nav-brand" href="#">
      <img src="/images/the-claws-logo.svg" alt="TheClaws" class="nav-brand-logo" />
      <span>AI Mortgage Admin</span>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#problem">Problem</a>
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#case">Case study</a>
      <a href="#incl">Included</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" href="#book">Book a call <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
  </nav>
</header>

<!-- ============ HERO (all above fold) ============ -->
<section class="hero wrap">
  <div class="hero-left">
    <div class="eyebrow reveal"><span class="dot"></span>Documents processed in <span class="counter" data-count="8" data-suffix=" minutes">8 minutes</span>, not hours</div>
    <h1 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">More cases submitted.<br><span class="mark">Less time lost to admin.</span></h1>
    <p class="sub reveal reveal-delay-2">Upload the case. AI Mortgage Admin reviews the file and drafts the client chase for whatever is missing.</p>
    <div class="btns reveal reveal-delay-3">
      <a class="btn btn-lime btn-magnet" href="#book">Book a call &amp; see it on your file <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#how">See how it works</a>
    </div>
    <p class="micro reveal reveal-delay-4">We'll review one live case on the call and show the gaps it would flag — bring the file, no prep needed.</p>

    <hr class="hero-divider reveal reveal-delay-4">

    <div class="hero-caps reveal reveal-delay-5">
      <div class="hero-cap">
        <span class="ic">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="8" y1="13" x2="16" y2="13"></line><line x1="8" y1="17" x2="16" y2="17"></line></svg>
        </span>
        <strong>Reads the whole file</strong>
        <span>Bank statements, credit file, payslips, deposits, protection.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cap">
        <span class="ic">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <strong>Drafts the chase</strong>
        <span>Written from the actual file. You review before sending.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cap">
        <span class="ic">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <strong>Fits your firm's rules</strong>
        <span>Your compliance wording, your network, your tone.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-stage">
    <img class="agent" src="/images/hero-ai-mortgage-admin.webp" alt="AI Mortgage Admin reviewing a case file">
    <div class="sbubble"><span class="spark"></span> What needs attention on case #2847?</div>

    <!-- Missing items -->
    <div class="fcard fcard-alert">
      <div class="fc-head">
        <span class="ic">!</span>
        <span>Missing items flagged</span>
        <span class="pill">4</span>
      </div>
      <div class="chip-list">
        <div class="chip-item"><svg class="chip-ic" width="11" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg><span><b>Payslip</b> · March</span></div>
        <div class="chip-item"><svg class="chip-ic" width="11" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg><span><b>Bank statement</b> · p.4</span></div>
        <div class="chip-item"><svg class="chip-ic" width="11" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg><span><b>Deposit source</b> · explanation</span></div>
        <div class="chip-item"><svg class="chip-ic" width="11" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg><span><b>Credit file</b> · missing</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Todo -->
    <div class="fcard fcard-todo">
      <div class="fc-head">
        <span class="ic">✓</span>
        <span>Todo List</span>
        <span class="pill lime">2 ITEMS</span>
      </div>
      <div class="todo-i">
        <div class="ti-head">🗂 Credit File<span class="ti-pill">Undisclosed</span></div>
        <div class="ti-sub">Hard search, undisclosed finance</div>
      </div>
      <div class="todo-i">
        <div class="ti-head">📝 Suitability Note<span class="ti-pill out">Reviewed</span></div>
        <div class="ti-sub">Declined CI cover rationale added</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- WA -->
    <div class="fcard fcard-wa">
      <div class="fc-head">
        <span class="ic ic-wa" aria-label="WhatsApp">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.297-.497.1-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span>WhatsApp chase</span>
        <span class="pill">Draft</span>
      </div>
      <div class="wa-msg">Hi Mr Smith, quick one to get your file submitted. Could you send me your March payslip, page 4 of your bank statement, and a short note explaining where the deposit came from?</div>
      <div class="wa-meta">
        <span>To: Mr Smith</span>
        <span class="send">Review &amp; send →</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========================= CLAIM TICKER ========================= -->
<div class="ticker-band">
  <div class="ticker">
    <span class="t-strong">What would you do with 15 extra hours a week?</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span>Because that's what the admin is costing you.</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span class="t-strong">Future brokers don't pay it anymore</span>
    <span class="t-sep">—</span>
    <span>they approve what their AI already packaged.</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <!-- duplicate for seamless loop -->
    <span class="t-strong">What would you do with 15 extra hours a week?</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span>Because that's what the admin is costing you.</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span class="t-strong">Future brokers don't pay it anymore</span>
    <span class="t-sep">—</span>
    <span>they approve what their AI already packaged.</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============ PROBLEM + REAL PROBLEM — combined ============ -->
<section id="problem" class="real bg-grid bg-grid-dark">
  <div class="wrap real-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="sec-label">The problem</div>
      <h2>Your advice is not the bottleneck. <em>Mortgage admin</em> is.</h2>
      <p>You already know how to advise. What slows you down is everything around it: checking statements, matching payslips, spotting credit issues, proving deposit source, writing notes, evidencing protection, and chasing missing documents.</p>
      <div class="problem-cards">
        <div class="pcard">
          <span class="pcard-k">01 / Doc review</span>
          <h4>Bank statements</h4>
          <p>Income, conduct, gambling, transfers, debts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pcard pcard-dark">
          <span class="pcard-k">02 / Adverse</span>
          <h4>Credit files</h4>
          <p>Missed payments, CCJs, debts, hard searches.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pcard">
          <span class="pcard-k">03 / Evidence</span>
          <h4>Case notes</h4>
          <p>Income, deposit, suitability, rationale.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pcard pcard-lime">
          <span class="pcard-k">04 / Client work</span>
          <h4>Client chase</h4>
          <p>Draft WhatsApps, emails, and follow-up questions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="real-col">
      <div class="transcript reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="sec-label">The real problem</div>

        <div class="transcript-stage">
          <img class="transcript-photo" src="/images/the-real-problem.png" alt="An exhausted mortgage advisor at a desk surrounded by paperwork" />

          <div class="stage-overlay">
            <div class="stage-quote-wrap">
              <blockquote class="stage-quote">
                I feel like I'm working at <span class="hl">full capacity</span>, but I can't grow because admin eats my time.
              </blockquote>
              <div class="sig stage-sig">— Advisor using AI Mortgage Admin</div>
            </div>

            <div class="notes-wall" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="note note-1">
                <span class="note-tape"></span>
                <p>"Submitted Friday. Declined Tuesday. Same issue as last one."</p>
                <span class="note-attr">— IFA, Birmingham</span>
              </div>
              <div class="note note-2 note-lime">
                <span class="note-tape"></span>
                <p>"Compliance checklist is 11 tabs. Miss one, lose the case."</p>
                <span class="note-attr">— Advisor, Bristol</span>
              </div>
              <div class="note note-3">
                <span class="note-tape"></span>
                <p>"Admin at 11pm. My family sees me less than my CRM."</p>
                <span class="note-attr">— Director, Manchester</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="body-txt">
          The admin around each case sets the cap. <strong>More cases means more statements to check</strong>, more credit files to read, more clients to chase, more notes to tidy. So the advisor either stops taking more cases, or takes them and pays for it with evenings and weekends.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ FIXES — problems + how it fits ============ -->
<section class="fixes">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="fixes-head reveal">
      <div class="sec-label fixes-eyebrow">
        <svg class="sl-ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.29 3.86 1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0Z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg>
        Why the usual fixes do not work
      </div>
      <h2>Hiring a case manager takes months. Templates <em>do not read the file</em>. Generic AI does not know a CCJ from a hard search.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="fix-row reveal reveal-delay-2">
      <div class="fix-card fc-fail">
        <span class="fc-badge fc-x" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h4>A case manager</h4>
        <p>Costs a full salary before it helps. Needs training on your firm's process, your network's quirks, and your protection rationale. Still leaves the advisor doing the judgement calls.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fix-card fc-fail">
        <span class="fc-badge fc-x" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h4>WhatsApp and email templates</h4>
        <p>Generic "please send more documents" messages. They do not look at the file, do not know what is actually missing, and the client ignores them or sends the wrong thing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fix-card fc-fail">
        <span class="fc-badge fc-x" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h4>Generic AI chatbots</h4>
        <p>Wait for you to explain the whole case from scratch every time. They do not understand gifted deposits, overseas transfers, defaults versus CCJs, or why a declined cover needs a file note.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fits-box reveal reveal-delay-3">
      <span class="fits-pill">
        <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
        How it fits
      </span>
      <div class="fits-body">
        <h3>A review and drafting layer. You stay the advisor on the file.</h3>
        <div class="fits-body-copy">
          <p>Every flag, every WhatsApp, every email is reviewed by you before anything moves. AI Mortgage Admin does not submit, send, or sign anything off.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fix-row fix-row-win">
        <div class="fix-card fc-win">
          <span class="fc-badge fc-check" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h4>You decide what goes out</h4>
          <p>It drafts, flags, and asks. It does not send, submit, or sign anything off.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fix-card fc-win">
          <span class="fc-badge fc-check" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h4>Built for UK mortgage files</h4>
          <p>Bank statements, credit file, CCJs, gifted deposits, protection notes. Not generic document review.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fix-card fc-win">
          <span class="fc-badge fc-check" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="9" y1="13" x2="15" y2="13"/><line x1="9" y1="17" x2="13" y2="17"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h4>Fits your firm's rules</h4>
          <p>Your compliance wording, your network's process, your approved tone. Configured at setup.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ HOW — step flow ============ -->
<section id="how" class="how bg-grid">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-label reveal">How it works</div>
    <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">Four steps from messy file to <em>submission-ready.</em></h2>

    <div class="how-flow">
      <div class="hstep reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <span class="hs-eyebrow">Step one</span>
        <h3>Upload the case documents</h3>
        <div class="hs-visual">
          <div class="doc-mock">
            <span class="doc-line w70"></span>
            <span class="doc-line w50"></span>
            <span class="doc-line w65"></span>
            <span class="doc-block"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Bank statements, credit file, payslips, deposit evidence, protection notes, fact find.</p>
        <span class="hs-tag">Drop the file</span>
      </div>

      <div class="hs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </div>

      <div class="hstep reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <span class="hs-eyebrow">Step two</span>
        <h3>AI Mortgage Admin reviews the file</h3>
        <div class="hs-visual">
          <div class="review-mock">
            <div class="rm-card-back"></div>
            <div class="rm-card">
              <span class="rm-head"></span>
              <span class="rm-line w60"></span>
              <span class="rm-line w45"></span>
              <span class="rm-reply" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="15 10 20 15 15 20"/><path d="M4 4v7a4 4 0 0 0 4 4h12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Checks every document, cross-references the story, flags what is missing or risky.</p>
        <span class="hs-tag">Full review</span>
      </div>

      <div class="hs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </div>

      <div class="hstep reveal reveal-delay-4">
        <span class="hs-eyebrow">Step three</span>
        <h3>You get flags, questions &amp; drafts</h3>
        <div class="hs-visual">
          <div class="chips-mock">
            <span class="cm-chip cm-1">Missing payslip</span>
            <span class="cm-chip cm-2">Undisclosed CCJ</span>
            <span class="cm-chip cm-3">Gifted deposit note</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Review the gaps, approve the WhatsApp or email chase, decide what goes to the client.</p>
        <span class="hs-tag">Clear gaps</span>
      </div>

      <div class="hs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </div>

      <div class="hstep reveal reveal-delay-5">
        <span class="hs-eyebrow">Step four</span>
        <h3>You submit a cleaner case</h3>
        <div class="hs-visual">
          <div class="tiles-mock">
            <span class="tm-tile tm-1">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 2 3 14h7l-1 8 10-12h-7z"/></svg>
            </span>
